From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tzarial <zork@google.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 19:32:31 +0000
Subject: Translator: Wrap struct constructors after init

When avoidComplexExpressionsInStructConstructor is enabled (e.g. on
PowerVR drivers), WrapStructConstructors was running before
InitializeUninitializedLocals. When uninitialized local variables of
struct type containing arrays were zero-initialized in ESSL 3.00,
InitializeUninitializedLocals generated struct constructors with
nested array constructors. Because WrapStructConstructors had
already run, these synthesized struct constructors remained
unwrapped, leading to shader compiler crashes and heap corruption in
the driver.

This change moves WrapStructConstructors to run after
InitializeUninitializedLocals in checkAndSimplifyAST, ensuring that
all struct constructors, including those synthesized for variable
initialization, are wrapped.

Bug: b/562777838
Test: angle_end2end_tests --gtest_filter="*StructConstructor*"
Change-Id: I568e671dcce6e17b0cff4f65f799795fc7f28a33
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/8420370
Reviewed-by: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Yuxin Hu <yuxinhu@google.com>

diff --git a/src/compiler/translator/Compiler.cpp b/src/compiler/translator/Compiler.cpp
index f8c8bede2f33f4ba18cebfc255acc57c116aaaa6..ef9eed5ba94716fb228c60cca7e126356ad4c8dd 100644
--- a/src/compiler/translator/Compiler.cpp
+++ b/src/compiler/translator/Compiler.cpp
@@ -1058,14 +1058,6 @@ bool TCompiler::checkAndSimplifyAST(TIntermBlock *root,
         }
     }
 
-    if (compileOptions.avoidComplexExpressionsInStructConstructor)
-    {
-        if (!WrapStructConstructors(this, root, &mSymbolTable))
-        {
-            return false;
-        }
-    }
-
     if (compileOptions.clampIndirectArrayBounds)
     {
         if (!ClampIndirectIndices(this, root, &mSymbolTable, mExtensionBehavior))
@@ -1153,6 +1145,15 @@ bool TCompiler::checkAndSimplifyAST(TIntermBlock *root,
         }
     }
 
+    if (compileOptions.avoidComplexExpressionsInStructConstructor)
+    {
+        // Must run after InitializeUninitializedLocals, as that would introduce struct constructors
+        if (!WrapStructConstructors(this, root, &mSymbolTable))
+        {
+            return false;
+        }
+    }
+
     if (compileOptions.clampPointSize)
     {
         if (!ClampPointSize(this, root, mResources.MinPointSize, mResources.MaxPointSize,
